\c 4
\cl Chapter Four
\cd This chapter description (cd) follows the chapter label (cl). Chapter 4 exercises standard USFM that chapters 1 through 3 do not use, plus shapes that pin known converter bugs. Chapter 5 holds deliberately damaged USFM.
\s1 A section heading before verse 1
\r (2 Sam 4.1-12)
\b
